{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_105_1000_p", "source_sha256": "af36b4b351400b820ff12361d4de81282829ac491a698da3999e876b363821c1", "ja": "千鶴さん、お疲れさまです。\n『ドラマMILLION』、すごく評判がいいですね。", "zh": "千鹤，辛苦了。\n《电视剧MILLION》的评价非常好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_105_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "deba4867e1d400281f54529efb89460d77dcea80672088b8631cff182cf0b950", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}。\nええ、わたくしも鼻が高いですわ。", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}。  \n是啊，我也觉得很自豪呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_105_1002_038chz", "source_sha256": "e06f5be90a608908b3a79831fe89febacfbac66f531ba92bb88f2fd886c9a0ae", "ja": "大学の友人にも、感想を言われましたの。\n身近な方から聞くと、実感がありますわね。", "zh": "大学朋友也对我说了感想。\n听身边的人这么说，才更有实感呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_105_1003_p", "source_sha256": "02cd34145202dd45d0a0399dc72c247aa8451715fb409cdd0df972f6f88e9dba", "ja": "ええ、そういうものですよね。", "zh": "是啊，确实就是这样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_105_1004_038chz", "source_sha256": "aa21bbcadeb89bf01c7d65c314c23d7162040308c2d5d722da90954890b86d63", "ja": "家族も、居間のテレビ……ではなく！\nし、シネマルームで見ているようでしたわ！？", "zh": "家里人好像也是在客厅的电视……不对！\n是、是在私人影院看的呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_105_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "558c802ba62845a86838da19c54f67fc578bd9adfc5dc6da07cb630053367fcc", "ja": "そうそう、家族と言えば……\n{$P$}、今よろしくて？", "zh": "对了，说到家人……\n{$P$}，现在方便吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_105_1006_p", "source_sha256": "45092facfefb39a80672ec970c86e9b833a71a421e78244a74aa7a84cc0c1653", "ja": "ええ、大丈夫ですけど……千鶴さん、どこに？", "zh": "嗯，没问题，不过……千鹤小姐要去哪儿？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_105_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "07a78888de873110b83375f834fed633713e79a61fd5753ef4b8df74bc043fab", "ja": "こちら、わたくしからの差し入れですわ。", "zh": "这是我带来的慰问品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_105_1008_p", "source_sha256": "e4f4e02dc69ed0cd130ae7665c4fd3606c38b17077e4398ab1a9a735572ee0dd", "ja": "これは……コロッケですか？\nしかも、こんなにたくさん……山盛りですね！", "zh": "这是……可乐饼吗？\n而且还有这么多……都堆成小山了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_105_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "7244ddf593959150294f16524e30cdea5cf464e81360b6c9030d679c01dadc5b", "ja": "半分はメンチカツですわ。お母……\nいえ、我が家のシェフが！　劇場のみなさんで、と。", "zh": "有一半是炸肉饼呢。妈妈……不，是我家的厨师！说是要给剧场的大家。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_105_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "f1a6efe7db29892c347c88328e3604bb15b308e2c49c1ac0c5f82c5975dd2dac", "ja": "みんなが来るまで、まだ時間がありますから。\n{$P$}、お先にどうぞ。", "zh": "离大家过来还有些时间。\n{$P$}，您先请用吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_105_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6d29ecd5ae8d702bd187377a1c630143bdfdabce271deb1fdee684c95ddcfbc8", "ja": "おおっ、ちょうど小腹が空いていたんですよ。\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "哦，正好有点饿了。\n谢谢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_105_1012_p", "source_sha256": "5337b66f3f7756b91ec7dd2d627bd205e4ca7d81b909b59197370f8ea1bd11a5", "ja": "あっ、まだ熱い……はふっ、はふっ。\nうん、すごく美味しいです！", "zh": "啊，还很烫……呼、呼。\n嗯，非常好吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_105_1013_038chz", "source_sha256": "3ba5fc07cd2fe717cd7fc4d28546a1467b0e735710e6b36785cfb30538dff802", "ja": "ふふ、よかったですわ。\nどうぞ、たくさん食べてくださいまし！", "zh": "呵呵，那就好。\n请尽管多吃一些吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_105_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "fa9c58b1420f1640f057c7124ae97939a2873775a54d02e965a7cc92554d00c3", "ja": "今のわたくしには、こうして\n差し入れを持参することが精いっぱいですが……。", "zh": "现在的我，也只能这样带着慰问品过来，已经是竭尽全力了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_105_1015_038chz", "source_sha256": "ce88d97f7468d3ae698a9d87355843344dec8d28f01999bb4280765e17409dd9", "ja": "いつか、{$P$}を我が家に\nご招待して……最高級の和牛をご馳走してみせますわ。", "zh": "总有一天，我会把{$P$}请到府上\n做客……让您尝尝最高级的和牛的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_105_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8af8edeab73214276a8de54b775b0ae5e17e87ebaa3e94e0ecbb69bb3f98e3c1", "ja": "このコロッケも、すごく美味しいですけど……\nそれはそれで、楽しみですね！", "zh": "这个可乐饼也非常好吃，不过……\n那也很令人期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_blst_105_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_105_1017_038chz", "source_sha256": "41ee041b1e9ef8a3ba111b98073354e7b1cb131126340655f4645f512a5a2f8f", "ja": "ええ。ですから、その時が来るまで、わたくしの\nプロデュースをお願いしますわ！　おーっほっほっほ！", "zh": "是的。所以，在那一刻到来之前，就拜托您负责我的制作了！哦呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
